**风险**

实现者可能误把 provider structured output 当成 hard guarantee。P13 文档已经写“provider native structured output 只作为优化；runtime validate + audit 才是 hard guarantee”：`docs/plans/迁移/p23/P13_StrictJSONOutput.md:64-67`，但还应在代码缺口清单里直接点名当前 only prompt / pass-through。

